<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100174" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπ-άγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lead together against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>join in bringing in against</i> another, of those who <i>call
				in a foreign force to aid</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				79
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				84
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>bring</i> or <i>take with one</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἀδελφόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).174.16
				</span></i>
			 (Cnidus, Epist. Aug.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1780.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				18.9.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				41.7
			</span></i>; <i>draw</i> a net <i>along with one</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.29
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.508
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐπιρρήματα ς. τὴν πρόθεσιν ἐπὶ τὰ
					ῥήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					338.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
